    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlaylist_SearchTooltip" xml:space="preserve">Search playlist. Supports:
- fuzzy matching and partial matching with * and ? wildcards
- scope narrowing with tag:, genre:, developer:/dev:, publisher:/pub:, category:/cat:, feature:/feat:
- inverting scope narrowing with ! (e.g.: !genre:shooter)
- quote values with spaces (e.g. tag:"Action Roguelike")
- comma or | (pipe) for OR; repeat scope or &amp; for AND</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlaylist_SearchClearTooltip">Clear search</sys:String>
